<h1>Welcome! Set your password</h1>
<p>Hello <strong>{{.name}}</strong>,</p>
<p>Your account is ready. Set a password to start using it.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px;"><tr><td bgcolor="#4f46e5" style="border-radius:8px;"><a href="{{.link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Set your password</a></td></tr></table>
<p class="muted">This link is valid for {{.expires_in}} days and works once.</p>
<p class="muted">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br><a href="{{.link}}" style="word-break:break-all;">{{.link}}</a></p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="background:#f9fafb;border-left:3px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#4b5563;">If you did not expect this e-mail, you can ignore it. No one can use your account until a password is set.</td></tr></table>
